~ start
[speed=0.8][shake rate=4 level=2]We're all here.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.8]Nanay. Tatay. Ate Valerie. Kuya Dodong. Noni. Kiki.[/speed]

[speed=0.8]Everyone is here.[/speed]

[speed=0.7]...[/speed]

[speed=0.7][shake rate=4 level=2]Kuya Dodong is hurt. The doctors said they couldn't save his leg.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.7]Ate Valerie helps Nanay take care of Kiki and Noni now. Even more so.[/speed]

[speed=0.7]Noni holds my hand whenever the rain gets loud.[/speed]

[speed=0.7]Kiki cries whenever it rains so Nanay holds her close.[/speed]

[speed=0.7]And Tatay...[/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=4 level=2]He doesn't talk much anymore.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=5 level=2]Sometimes, I see him staring at nothing.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.6]I wonder what he's thinking about.[/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=5 level=2]I think he's sad too.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.7]...[/speed]

[speed=0.7][shake rate=5 level=2]Our house is gone.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.7][shake rate=5 level=2]My toys are gone too.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=5 level=2]I miss my bed. I miss our bedroom.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.5][shake rate=6 level=3]I miss when rain was just rain.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.8]But we're all still here.[/speed]

[speed=0.7][shake rate=4 level=2]That's what matters, right?[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.7]...[/speed]

[speed=0.7]It was my birthday.[/speed]

[speed=0.7]I'm eight now...[/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=4 level=2]I wish we could've celebrated at home.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.5][shake rate=5 level=2]I wish everything was still the same.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.7]...[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8]Nay, can we go home someday?[/speed]

PILI: [speed=0.8]We'll find our way, anak.[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.7]...Okay.[/speed]

[speed=0.7]I'll wait.[/speed]

[speed=0.7]...[/speed]

[speed=0.8]We'll find our way home.[/speed]

=> END